          <style sizeComputationExpression="2" routingStyle="manhattan" endsCentering="Both" centeredSourceMappings="//@ownedViewpoints[name='ActivityFlowDiagrams']/@ownedRepresentations[name='ActivityDiagram']/@defaultLayer/@containerMappings[name='Activity']" centeredTargetMappings="//@ownedViewpoints[name='ActivityFlowDiagrams']/@ownedRepresentations[name='ActivityDiagram']/@defaultLayer/@nodeMappings[name='ConditionNode']">
            <strokeColor xsi:type="description:SystemColor" href="environment:/viewpoint#//@systemColors/@entries[name='gray']"/>
